    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE COCONUT DEVELOPMENT ACT, NO. 46 OF 1971",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.61,
      401.9,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.61,
      401.89,
      331.91
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Coconut Development(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.61,
      401.87,
      396.95
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Coconut Development Act, No. 46of 1971 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d)is hereby amended in subsection (1) of that section asfollows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.89,
      411.65,
      401.88,
      435.95
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the substitution in paragraph (ix), for the words\u201cthe Board; and\u201d of the words \u201cthe Board;\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.89,
      450.53,
      401.87,
      474.95
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the insertion immediately after paragraph (ix) ofthat subsection, of the following new paragraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      489.53,
      401.88,
      539.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(ixa) appoint a Working Director, inaccordance with the provisions of section2A, who shall not be a member of theBoard; and\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      554.57,
      401.91,
      591.95
    ],
    "text": "3.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 2 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 2A of that enactment:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      606.53,
      401.88,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "2A.(1) The Minister may appoint to anyBoard established under the provisions ofsection 2 of this Act, a Working Director fromamong persons who have had wide experiencein the area of coconut development.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      309.55,
      446.13,
      318.62
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
